OL,3,GNEWSANHS workers call off strike after
OL,4,Apay offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers at Scotland's largest health
OL,7,Fboard have called off a planned
OL,8,Fthree-day strike after receiving an
OL,9,Fimproved offer in a dispute over pay.
OL,11,FWard clerks at NHS Greater Glasgow and
OL,12,FClyde (NHSGGC) had been due to walk out
OL,13,Ffrom Monday but Unison members voted to
OL,14,Fcall off the action after receiving a
OL,15,Frevised offer from the health board.
OL,17,FThe union said the deal could mean a
OL,18,Fpay increase of more than #2,000 for
OL,19,Fthe most experienced workers, with some
OL,20,Falso potentially receiving up to three
OL,21,Fyears' back pay.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
